re posts \nis not available with us as re servation rosters are maintained  by cadre controlling authority. \nHowever, the same is available in respect of Se nior Secretariat Assistant (SSA) which is also a \ncentralized post but reservation rost er is maintained in this Department. As per this roster there \nare 4 & 1 posts of SSA are va cant for the persons belonging to SC & ST respectively. \nReservation is not applicable for OBC category in promotions.  \nPosts in respect of which MHRD is the cad re controlling authority (Advisory posts, \nProgrammer, Book Promotion) have only 1 sa nctioned post each, hence reservation is not \napplicable to these.  \nDetails in respect of posts of other Minist ries (e.g. Translators, Statistical Officers, \nOfficial Language officer, ALIO) is also not ava ilable with this Department as their roster is \nmaintained in their respective cadre controlling Ministries/ Departments. \n*** \n \n \n \n \n \n  \n\n6 \n \nANNEXURE –II \n \n \nANNEXURE AS REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PARTS (c) OF LOK SABHA \nSTARRED QUESTION NO. 101 TO BE AN SWERRED ON 11.02.2019 ASKED BY SHRI \nGANESH SINGH REGARDING VACANT POSTS \n \nStatement for outsourcing staffs in Main  Secretariat, Ministry of Human Resource \nDevelopment is given as below:  \n \n \n*** \n  \nS. No Post Monthly Wages (In \nRs.) \nName of Company No. of \nEmployees \n1 Data Entry Operator 18,332/- Educational Consultants  India \nLimited  \n85 \n2 Helper 13,584 Educational Consultants  India \nLimited  \n35 \n3 Driver 14958 Educational Consultants  India \nLimited  \n3 \n\n7 \n \nAnnexure-III \nANNEXURE AS REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PARTS (c) OF LOK SABHA \nSTARRED QUESTION NO. 101 TO BE AN SWERRED ON 11.02.2019 ASKED BY SHRI \nGANESH SINGH REGARDING VACANT POSTS \n \n (1) Statement for outsourcing staffs in Central University given as below: \nThe data on persons engaged in Cent ral Universities through outsourcing is not centrally maintained by \nUGC.  However, details of Adhoc / Guest / 